  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Cut the capsicum into 2cm chunks. Halve the zucchini lengthwise, then thinly slice on an angle. Thinly slice the spring onion, including the green part. Drain and rinse half the baby corn, then halve on an angle. Coarsely chop the cashews. Crush or finely chop 2 garlic cloves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/239437/photos/large/prep_ingredients-353c63684e5b8d5bfe68706bbbb7fdcb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Soak noodles: Put three-quarters of the noodles in a large heatproof bowl, cover generously with boiling water and soak for 2 mins, using a fork to gently separate the noodles after they start to soften. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/239438/photos/large/soak_noodles-adce8f2f6416c04aa123a576611842a9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir-fry veggies: Heat 1 tbs vegetable oil in a large frypan over medium-high heat. Stir-fry the capsicum for 2 mins. Add the zucchini, corn, garlic and 2 tsp vegetable oil and stir-fry for 2 mins or until the zucchini is tender but still with crunch. Add half the spring onion and stir-fry for a further 1 min or until softened.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/239439/photos/large/stir_fry_veggies-147de363206d3ec6d5ebc5e2d7bf1b71.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add sauce: Add the sweet and sour sauce, 1 tbs soy sauce and 2 tsp water to the pan and bring to the boil. Add the noodles and stir-fry for a further 1 min or until warmed through. Remove the pan from the heat. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/239440/photos/large/add_sauce-4c38c21e56e4448d9aab2382380b8f0c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the veggie stir-fry among bowls. Scatter over the cashews and remaining spring onion and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/239441/photos/large/serve_up-beb4ced967471f89f3d0d6d2bbc924f5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen 101: The stir-fry is best served immediately so the noodles don't soak up all the delicious sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/239442/photos/large/kitchen_101-3a37df97e051991b1fcbe87ad35823bb.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
